Feature: a red suite observed by a reviewing role is dispositioned, never passed over in silence

  # BL-816 — DRAFT, deliberately not executable.
  #
  # This ticket amends constitution and role-prompt text; there is no runtime
  # behaviour for a step handler to drive. A live .feature here would hand the
  # acceptance runner unhandled scenarios and hard-fail the hardener's gate
  # (BL-233). Verification is the ticket's QA procedure plus the article diff.
  #
  # Kept because the shape is the contract: what a role owes when the suite is
  # red and it forwards anyway.

  Background:
    Given a reviewing role that ran the unit suite as part of its pass

  # BL-816 red-suite-requires-a-disposition-01
  Scenario: forwarding past a red suite requires a recorded disposition
    Given the suite came back red
    And the role judges the failures unrelated to its parcel
    When the role forwards the parcel
    Then its evidence file records the failing set by file and test name
    And its evidence file records the host load average at the time
    And its evidence file records a classification and the reason for it

  # BL-816 silence-is-not-a-disposition-02
  Scenario: a forward with no disposition is incomplete
    Given the suite came back red
    And the role's evidence file records no disposition for it
    When the pass is reviewed
    Then the pass is treated as incomplete

  # BL-816 environmental-claim-carries-its-basis-03
  Scenario Outline: calling a failure environmental carries its basis
    Given the suite came back red
    And the role classifies a failure as environmental
    And the role <isolation-disposition>
    When the pass is reviewed
    Then the pass is treated as <verdict>

    Examples:
      | isolation-disposition                        | verdict    |
      | records a passing isolated re-run            | complete   |
      | states explicitly that it attempted none     | complete   |
      | records nothing about isolation at all       | incomplete |

  # BL-816 forwarding-stays-permitted-04
  Scenario: a complete disposition permits the forward
    Given the suite came back red
    And the role recorded a complete disposition
    When the role forwards the parcel
    Then the forward is permitted

  # BL-816 green-suite-needs-no-disposition-05
  Scenario: a green suite carries no extra obligation
    Given the suite came back green
    When the role forwards the parcel
    Then no disposition is required
